  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_typed_phase_instructions",
   "label": "Six typed allocation instructions discover_rows / apply_senior / seal_weights / allocate_rows / prune_rows / commit_ticket with expected_ticket_id, expected_cursor and 1..=8 rows; StaleTicket 6039 / StaleCursor 6040",
   "file_type": "concept",
   "source_file": "solana/programs/musical_chairs/src/allocation.rs",
   "source_location": "L1123",
   "status": "local_runtime_executed",
   "rationale": "Commit e78d652 (IMPL-28). Remaining accounts per row; snapshot pages tagged by ticket; cursor reused across phases (ascending Discover/Allocate, descending Prune).",
   "community": 1333
  },
  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_u256_discovery_and_sealed_denominator",
   "label": "Discovery accumulates Series A remainders in U256; seal freezes the post-senior denominator; a dead A pool and the B floor residue route to seed; allocate pays full-pool floor shares with the A residue derived at the last batch",
   "file_type": "concept",
   "source_file": "solana/programs/musical_chairs/src/allocation.rs",
   "source_location": "L585",
   "status": "local_runtime_executed",
   "rationale": "The coordinator brief's slice-decrement scheme under-paid later rows and was correctly replaced: shares use the full A pool, residue = toll − credited − seed_credit bounded by the open A count, so credited + seed_credit == toll by construction. Goldens 5,001/2,363+1,636/500+500; 5,750/1,000+3,250; 8,000/1,000/1,000.",
   "community": 1333
  },
  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_prune_and_aliases",
   "label": "Prune swap-deletes capped rows with the two legitimate aliases (shared registry page; moved == pruned at the last live slot), rejects duplicate independent writable Backers, and prunes rows newly capped by the ticket when real accounts are supplied",
   "file_type": "concept",
   "source_file": "solana/programs/musical_chairs/src/allocation.rs",
   "source_location": "L81",
   "status": "local_runtime_executed",
   "rationale": "Resolves draft Defects 8/9 and finding F4 (same-page swap-delete; inverted alias write). Placeholder for skipped rows = program id.",
   "community": 1333
  },
  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_claim_backer_lazy",
   "label": "claim_backer() materializes finalized pending credit lazily over A and B (watermark = pool.finalized_ticket) and pays funded amounts from the vault; NothingToClaim on replay",
   "file_type": "concept",
   "source_file": "solana/programs/musical_chairs/src/claims.rs",
   "source_location": "L74",
   "status": "local_runtime_executed",
   "rationale": "Commit e78d652. Lifetime unchanged by claims; commit adds pending to funded_claims exactly once.",
   "community": 1333
  },
  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_apply_senior_optional_backer",
   "label": "ApplySenior.backer is optional: a ticket with no open A accepts the program-id placeholder (Anchor None) instead of a writable stand-in",
   "file_type": "concept",
   "source_file": "solana/programs/musical_chairs/src/allocation.rs",
   "source_location": "L1083",
   "status": "local_runtime_executed",
   "rationale": "Commit cabfd01 after the harness showed the mandatory mut account failing Anchor ConstraintMut (2000) on the placeholder.",
   "community": 1333
  },
  {
   "id": "impl2026_10_14_m6_allocation_suite",
   "label": "LiteSVM allocation suite: 18 rows / 657 observations on ELF 24716634…; the last M0 RED label (discover_row) is GREEN; chunk sizes 1/4/8 produce an identical digest and match the economics Book",
